WEBVTT

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.660
What... is this?

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.840
What were you doing?

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.840
What were you doing here?

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.010
What were you doing, lchise?!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.800
Keep on holding me

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.800
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.680
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.680
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:57.500
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:57.500
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.830
The precious arms

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:07.670
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:07.690
I have been searching for so hard

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:15.000
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:15.000
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:24.500
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:24.500
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:31.750
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:31.750
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:39.650
But if you remain by my side

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:39.650
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:43.960
Keep on holding me

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:43.960
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.630
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.630
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:54.800
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:54.800
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:00.150
This love...

00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:00.150
Omoi wo

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.110
What was that about?

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.780
She was trying to protect us.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.660
But...

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.750
We had no choice but to shoot.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.960
Inspector Wong would like to see you.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.460
All right.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:18.460
The Visitor

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.630
Kurau...

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.590
Are you okay?

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.220
Where's Christmas?

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.670
She's in another pod. Don't worry.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.640
Let me see her.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.980
I want to talk to you first.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:34.480
It won't take long.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.540
Let me begin.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:59.300
Several years ago, I received an
unusual order from the top.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:04.540
The order was to find the whereabouts of
a girl who possesses special powers.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.740
I thought there was no way
a girl like that would be found.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:13.390
Back then, I was just fascinated by the
beautiful scenery of this country.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:20.600
On the day I was to leave,
I went to a lake in the mountains.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:42.920
That was you.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.970
I didn't even report seeing you to Headquarters.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.930
I disobeyed orders.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.390
Inspector Wong!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:56.270
Since that time, I've had my suspicions about the GPO top officials.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.230
What were they going to do with you?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.400
What were they after?

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.360
I've come here to find that out.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.570
Inspector Wong! What are you talking about?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.640
So what were they after?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.970
To artificially create a Ryna sapien.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:19.210
By creating someone like you with special powers,
and putting them under their control,

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.460
GPO wants to become powerful organization.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.380
That's ridiculous!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.880
There's no way the GPO would knowingly create dangerous Ryna sapiens!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:32.100
But it's true. That boy was a Ryna sapien created by the GPO.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:35.810
And he may not be the only one.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.270
If we had captured him unharmed,

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:42.700
I would've grilled the top officials,
and made them stop their plans.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:43.820
However...

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.740
it's too late now...

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:55.120
Yvon's dead... Both Rynax and human together...

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.210
For something like that...

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.970
It's too late... You're absolutely right.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.700
But I can't give up now.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.180
I'm so glad you're alive.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.850
I won't tell Headquarters.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.520
You and Christmas will be released here.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:26.420
I don't think we'll ever meet again.
Please... Stay alive...

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.220
Why?

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.930
Why did you want me to hear it too?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.940
I thought I would have to tell you one day.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.270
But it wasn't something that was easy to say.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.570
Reporting, sir! The girl has woken up!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.320
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:28.480
I first started suspecting the GPO when your father, former Commissioner Steiger, died.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.090
It's great to have you back, Kurau...

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.380
What about that boy?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.390
I see...

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.660
That man, Wong, also talked about Dad.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.160
Is he safe?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:44.120
Yes. He's at a facility on the Moon, treating
victims of the Rynax Energy accident...

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.210
If he's with the GPO, then I guess we can't contact him.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.230
He said he'd let only Dad know that we're alive.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.300
I see.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.890
Is it okay to trust him?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.060
What did you think?

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.690
I can trust him... That's what I thought.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:11.150
If that's how you feel, then I'm sure that man's determination is real.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:16.780
But... But he has an uphill battle.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:23.950
Will one man be able to expose the dark side
of a powerful organization like the GPO?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.210
Kurau...

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:32.920
You are alive. Do you have any idea how
happy that makes your aunt and me?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:39.550
I want you to live peacefully here from now on. That is our wish.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.720
Thank you, Uncle Frank.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.420
I had a strange dream...

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.430
About what?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.930
About you.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.180
Me?

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:27.390
I was sleeping in a meadow.
But I was you, Kurau.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:32.530
I heard a voice... A gentle voice...

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:35.530
It said, "I'm always here."

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.900
That voice was you.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.910
You think so?

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:04.930
You know, Kurau... That time...
When the Rynax were pouring out of me...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:10.980
The Rynax were happy to come out into this world.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:18.320
Even though this world is full of dangers, like losing your Pair or being chased by people...

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.910
They didn't care, they were
just happy to come out.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.660
Is this world better off without the Rynax?

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:40.190
Christmas... Winter's almost here.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.010
Winter?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.430
When winter comes, the mountains
turn pure white with snow.

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:48.600
It'll be so pretty...

00:11:52.570 --> 00:12:00.820
At that time, I was thinking of all the Rynax that
I don't know about, wandering in this world.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.000
Family of 
three murdered

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.770
Home of GPO 
Commissioner 
Burglarized

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.930
Vice Commissioner Saito Promoted to New Commissioner of GPO!

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.280
Oh, it's you...

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:36.230
So this is why you've been
out of your office all day lately...

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:38.520
Thank you.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.090
Have you been getting any rest?

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.570
No... I'm going home now.

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:51.200
Inspector Wong, please let me help too.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.710
This affects me too.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.540
I can do it alone!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.000
Besides, it'll soon be over.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.640
So it was true that Inspector Wong was transferred.

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.390
I heard he can't be reached.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.000
What's going on here?!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.600
What happened?

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.730
Where is the inspector now? Ayaka!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:11.830
I first started suspecting the GPO when your father, former Commissioner Steiger, died.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:17.830
There was a mastermind behind whoever killed your family.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.790
I heard that a high-ranking official was questioned.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.420
Even that was faked.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.920
Then... Who was behind it?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.420
The then Vice-Commissioner.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:32.510
The current GPO Commissioner, Kaneyoshi Saito.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.930
He's the ringleader that murdered
your father and family.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.060
Papa...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.870
What do you think I should do?

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:01.590
Yes...

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.420
This is Headquarters calling.
Is this Detective Ayaka Steiger?

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.880
I'll connect you to Commissioner Saito.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.970
Wait! What's going on?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.840
It's been a long time.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:16.380
Commissioner, why would you be calling me?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.750
No, no, it's not about work.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:24.400
There's this pianist I really like. She'll be giving a performance at a club I frequent.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.050
It's a small club, but it's got great acoustics.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.260
I'm not sure what you're saying...

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.720
I'll send over a ticket, so please join me.

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:34.230
Me? Why?

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.000
You're all that's left of a precious friend.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.910
I'd like to see your face once in a while. I look forward to it.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:21.960
I'm home.

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.150
Ryna sapien?!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:57.990
This is...

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:01.910
This is...

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.250
This is...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:04.830
Ryna Sapiens

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.100
Ryna Sapiens

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.290
Artificial infection

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.690
Change in personality

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.690
Abnormal mental structure

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:09.320
Annihilation

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:09.900
Failed case

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.380
This is...

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.550
This can't be...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:20.930
This is data from the GPO's
Ryna sapien experiments?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.100
Inspector Wong?!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:33.190
What does he want me to do? About the Rynax...

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.110
Inspector Wong...

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.250
Rynax...

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.170
But...

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:03.310
You...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.810
I'm Ayaka...

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.940
I am here to see you...

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.820
not as a member of the GPO, but as a human being.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.660
Okay... I'll hear you out.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.000
I see...

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.670
So he's been transferred and his
whereabouts are unknown...

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.300
Why are you telling me this?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:43.390
Because... you're a Rynax.
There was no one else I could talk to.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.730
What do you intend to do?

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:51.810
I don't know... But I don't want to go back to the GPO.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:56.690
When I think about what the
Commissioner did to my family...

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.690
Such a horrible... horrible thing...

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:05.410
And to think they're merging Rynax with people!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:09.750
The GPO is conducting experiments,
implanting Rynax into humans.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.280
All to strengthen the GPO...

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:16.250
Yvon died over nonsense like that!

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:22.010
That boy... That Rynax died. He died!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.760
I had no idea what was happening...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:31.500
Even though I was pursuing you as a GPO, I didn't know at all...

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.530
I wonder what they're talking about?

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.570
It's okay.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.830
If Kurau decided to talk to her, then it should be okay.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.830
Christmas...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.830
it'll be okay...

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.250
What is this?

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:59.260
Data that Inspector Wong sent me.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:01.360
They look alike.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.180
They're twins.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.550
They're both members of
the GPO Special Missions Unit.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.770
Headquarters conducted experiments
on both of them at the same time.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:18.410
I know from Inspector Wong's report that they went to Earth after receiving an order.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.030
But I don't know where they went after that.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.650
Are they a Pair?

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.160
A Pair?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:27.410
That's right. Like Christmas and me.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.060
Are those two a Pair too?

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.520
That's what it said in his report.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:35.060
I wonder if they're really following orders...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.330
What do you mean?

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.550
Their movements are probably
dictated by the Rynax's will.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.470
Rynax's will?

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.880
Their instinct makes them want to
go out into the wide world.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.720
The wide world...

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:49.110
If that's the case, then the GPO will go after them.

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.600
They'll go after those twins just like they did that boy.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.350
No, you can't corner them.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:57.360
Rynax won't hurt people if you leave them alone.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.860
But the GPO Will...

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.730
I'll look for these two.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:06.360
What?

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.120
Yes... That's what's best.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.610
I'm an Agent. So hire me.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:16.880
Kurau...

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:20.380
You collect the information and I'll act on it.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:25.380
But why? You may be found by the GPO too.

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:28.650
I don't want anyone else to die.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.850
Rynax or human...

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:46.870
From a great distance

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:46.870
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
You smile at me

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.350
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.350
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:14.430
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:14.430
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:23.670
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:23.670
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:51.030
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:51.030
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:00.240
Moonlight

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:00.240
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.870
Next Episode

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:15.620
We cannot keep peace by simply
placing a high value on life.

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:18.500
No... You're wrong.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.920
You are doing something that
should never be done.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
Each Path
